fsqrt, fsqrtl, dsqrt, dsqrtl \- narrowing (single-rounding) arithmetic
.SH LIBRARY
Math library (libm, \-lm)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <math.h>
.PP
.BI "double fadd(double " x ", double " y );
.br
